flowchart TD
    A["Reviewer uploads proposals and picks category"] --> B["Extract text from PDF (code)"]
    B --> C["Load admin criteria, weights and version (code)"]
    C --> D["AI: extract fields with evidence quotes. Proposal text treated as untrusted data"]
    D --> E["Validate output against schema (code)"]
    E --> F{"Mandatory criteria met? (code)"}
    F -- No --> G["Mark ineligible with reason"]
    F -- Yes --> H["AI: score weighted criteria with evidence"]
    H --> I{"Injection or missing data? (code rules + AI check)"}
    I -- Yes --> J["Flag for human review"]
    I -- No --> K["Compute weighted total and rank (code)"]
    G --> L["Human review: confirm or override with reason"]
    J --> L
    K --> L
    L --> M["Ranked list with reasons shown"]
    M --> N["Human makes the award decision"]
    N --> O["Audit log: inputs, versions, scores, overrides"]

    classDef ai fill:#ffe0b2,stroke:#e65100,color:#000
    classDef rule fill:#bbdefb,stroke:#1565c0,color:#000
    classDef human fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#000
    class D,H ai
    class B,C,E,F,K,G,O rule
    class L,N,J human

    subgraph Legend
      X1["AI step"]:::ai
      X2["Rule or code step"]:::rule
      X3["Human checkpoint"]:::human
    end
